#ENTRY      E0970
#AUTHOR1    H.Iida+
#YEAR       1984
#INSTITUTE  (2JPNTSU)
#TITLE      Drastic changes of (p,t) analyzing powers for the
#+          isotopes 58,60,62,64Ni and marked incident-energy
#+          dependence of the analyzing powers as evidence for
